<section class="surface content-panel"><p class="eyebrow">Trust starts with transparency</p><h1>Development terms and privacy</h1>
<p>This service is under development. Use it only for authorized testing until final college-approved policies are published.</p>
<p>Registration stores your name, email, optional student ID and hashed password in PostgreSQL. Verification emails use the configured SMTP provider. Product images are stored in Cloudinary and visible publicly with your listing and display name. Your email address is not displayed on listings.</p>
<p>Do not upload prohibited, private, copyrighted or misleading content. Only upload images you have permission to share. Email verification confirms email access and does not establish college affiliation. Contact the deployment operator for deletion or privacy requests.</p>
